&lt;p&gt;Site title. This value will become the content of &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;title&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; tag in html.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bookcase Layout Document</title><link>/layouts/bookcase/docs/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>kaiiiz</author><guid>/layouts/bookcase/docs/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Bookcase layout is useful for creating another viewpoint of list contents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This layout can only be used on section page (&lt;code&gt;_index.md&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 class="header-anchor-wrapper"&gt;Configuration
&lt;a href="#configuration" class="header-anchor-link"&gt;
