&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You need &amp;ldquo;extended&amp;rdquo; version of hugo to support SASS. Checkout &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io/getting-started/installing/"&gt;Install Hugo&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>